From 23619913a340acfab9a18c6b6bfe40343e970f28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Sep 2024 14:06:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/15] sock: Add an xlio sock module

XLIO is a userspace TCP stack developed by NVIDIA. The source code is
available on GitHub at https://github.com/mellanox/libxlio.

While XLIO supports hooking standard POSIX socket APIs via LD_PRELOAD,
we instead use a dedicated C API called XLIO ULTRA that is designed
specifically for poll mode, high performance applications.

Change-Id: I4af0f6f75c03dcfc641b53ae51c764e2fe8074d5
Signed-off-by: Ben Walker <ben@nvidia.com>
